    "output_token_ids_sha256": "871dfaa7e6f4ca7fc8ccac175b80a4f20fea8976095e016d682fbd74937bc9ae",
    "raw_output": "```rust\npub fn run_session(events: &[&str]) -> Option<String> {\n    let mut state = \"closed\";\n    let mut valid = true;\n\n    for event in events {\n        match event {\n            \"open\" => {\n                if state == \"closed\" {\n                    state = \"open\";\n                } else {\n                    valid = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            \"authenticate\" => {\n                if state == \"open\" {\n                    state = \"ready\";\n                } else {\n                    valid = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            \"ready\" => {\n                if state == \"ready\" {\n                    state = \"ready\";\n                } else if state == \"open\" {\n                    state = \"closed\";\n                } else {\n                    valid = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            \"ping\" => {\n                if state == \"ready\" {\n                    state = \"ready\";\n                } else {\n                    valid = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            \"close\" => {\n                if state == \"open\" || state == \"ready\" {\n                    state = \"closed\";\n                } else {\n                    valid = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            _ => {\n                valid = false;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    if valid {\n        Some(state.to_string())\n    } else {\n        None\n    }\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
